@startuml
actor User
participant "Chat Client" as ChatClient
participant "TokenMin Watcher" as TokenMin
participant "SQLite Queue" as Queue
participant "Remote LLM" as LLM

User -> ChatClient: Enter prompt (model: copilot-chat)
ChatClient -> Queue: INSERT message (status: pending)
TokenMin -> Queue: Poll pending messages
TokenMin -> TokenMin: Check BYPASS_MODELS config
note right of TokenMin: "copilot-chat" is in BYPASS_MODELS
TokenMin -> Queue: UPDATE message (status: skipped, processed_content = raw_content)
ChatClient -> Queue: Read processed_content
ChatClient -> LLM: Send original prompt
LLM -> ChatClient: Return response
@enduml
